{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>אזרה.</b> From the heavy binyan with dagesh. And it is not enough that you scatter, until I draw a sword after you." "And the meaning of <b>אריק</b> is from its root." "<b>והשמתי אני את הארץ.</b> Joined with the verse that follows it, and the meaning is: when your land is a desolation."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:48.390743926Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}